[{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-061","subject":"生理学","topic":"心筋の生理","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"心筋が骨格筋のような強縮を起こしにくい主な理由はどれか。","choices":["活動電位と不応期が長い","筋小胞体をもたない","カルシウムを利用しない","ATPを必要としない","自律神経支配を受けない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"心筋＝長い活動電位・不応期。強縮を防ぎ、拡張して血液を充満させる時間を確保。","explanation":"心室筋では活動電位のプラトー相により絶対不応期が収縮期間の大部分を占める。このため刺激が短時間に重なって強縮することが抑えられ、拍動ごとに拡張期を確保できる。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Cardiac Muscle Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK537140/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK538143/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"61","rightsBasis":"心筋生理の一般原則を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-062","subject":"生理学","topic":"筋紡錘の求心性線維","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"筋紡錘の一次終末から伸張速度と筋長の変化を速く伝える主要な求心性線維はどれか。","choices":["Ia群線維","Ib群線維","III群線維","IV群線維","C線維のみ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"筋紡錘一次終末＝Ia。二次終末＝II。腱器官＝Ib。","explanation":"筋紡錘の一次終末は太いIa群求心性線維で、筋長とその変化速度に応答し、伸張反射の速い入力を担う。II群は主に静的筋長、Ib群はGolgi腱器官からの入力を伝える。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Muscle Stretch Reflex","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK10809/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK551629/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"62","rightsBasis":"筋紡錘生理の一般事実を独自作問。模式図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-063","subject":"生理学","topic":"体温調節","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"暑熱環境で深部体温が上昇したとき、熱放散を促す生理反応はどれか。","choices":["皮膚血管拡張と発汗","皮膚血管収縮とふるえ","立毛と代謝亢進のみ","骨格筋の不随意収縮増加","末梢循環の完全停止"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"暑い→皮膚血管拡張＋発汗。寒い→血管収縮＋ふるえ。","explanation":"体温上昇時には視床下部を中心とする体温調節機構により皮膚血流が増え、発汗による蒸発熱と皮膚からの放熱が促進される。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Thermoregulation","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK499843/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK537171/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"63","rightsBasis":"体温調節の一般生理を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-064","subject":"生理学","topic":"嫌気性解糖","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"酸素供給が十分でない状況で、骨格筋が解糖系からグルコース1分子あたり正味で得るATPは何分子か。","choices":["1","2","4","12","36"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"解糖系単独＝正味2 ATP/グルコース。ピルビン酸→乳酸でNAD+を再生。","explanation":"解糖系ではグルコース1分子から4 ATPが生成される一方で2 ATPを消費するため、正味2 ATPとなる。酸素不足時にはピルビン酸が乳酸へ還元されNAD+が再生される。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Muscle Energy / Glycolysis","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK559029/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK482280/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"64","rightsBasis":"エネルギー代謝の一般事実を独自計算問題化。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-065","subject":"生理学","topic":"副交感神経と分泌","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"副交感神経活動で促進される反応はどれか。","choices":["唾液分泌の増加","瞳孔散大","心拍数増加","立毛筋収縮","皮膚血管の一律収縮"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"副交感＝消化・分泌を促進。唾液腺、涙腺、消化腺など。","explanation":"副交感神経は唾液腺や消化管分泌などを促進し、休息・消化に適した状態を作る。瞳孔散大や心拍数増加は主に交感神経作用である。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Autonomic Nervous System","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK539845/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK553141/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"65","rightsBasis":"自律神経生理の一般原則を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-066","subject":"生理学","topic":"酸塩基平衡とアルカローシス","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"過換気が持続した直後に生じやすい一次性の酸塩基平衡異常はどれか。","choices":["呼吸性アルカローシス","呼吸性アシドーシス","代謝性アシドーシス","代謝性アルカローシスだけ","酸塩基平衡は変化しない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"過換気→PaCO2低下→呼吸性アルカローシス。低換気→呼吸性アシドーシス。","explanation":"過換気では二酸化炭素排出が増えてPaCO2が低下し、炭酸濃度が低下するためpHは上昇方向へ動く。急性期の一次性変化は呼吸性アルカローシスである。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Respiratory Alkalosis","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK482117/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK531504/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"66","rightsBasis":"酸塩基生理の一般原則を独自作問。臨床の個別血液ガス診断ではない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-067","subject":"生理学","topic":"体液性免疫","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"抗体を大量に分泌する細胞はどれか。","choices":["形質細胞","好中球","赤血球","血小板","骨芽細胞"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"B細胞→形質細胞→免疫グロブリン分泌。","explanation":"抗原刺激を受けたBリンパ球は分化して形質細胞となり、特異的な免疫グロブリンを産生・分泌して体液性免疫を担う。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Humoral Immunity","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK531504/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK27140/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"67","rightsBasis":"免疫学の一般事実を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-068","subject":"生理学","topic":"排便中枢","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"排便反射を強める仙髄副交感神経の主な脊髄分節はどれか。","choices":["C1〜C4","T1〜T4","T6〜T9","S2〜S4","Co1のみ"],"correctIndices":[3],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"骨盤内臓神経＝S2〜S4。排便・排尿の副交感神経で重要。","explanation":"直腸伸展の情報は骨盤神経を介して仙髄へ伝わり、S2〜S4由来の副交感神経活動が下行結腸・S状結腸・直腸の収縮と内肛門括約筋弛緩を促進する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Physiology, Defecation","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK539732/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"68","rightsBasis":"排便生理の一般事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-069","subject":"運動学","topic":"肩甲骨の筋と運動","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"肩甲骨の上方回旋に協働する筋の組合せとして適切なのはどれか。","choices":["前鋸筋と僧帽筋上部・下部線維","菱形筋と肩甲挙筋だけ","小胸筋と菱形筋だけ","広背筋と大円筋だけ","上腕二頭筋と上腕筋だけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"上方回旋force couple＝前鋸筋＋僧帽筋上部/下部。","explanation":"上肢挙上時の肩甲骨上方回旋では、前鋸筋と僧帽筋上部・下部線維がforce coupleとして協働する。菱形筋や肩甲挙筋は主に下方回旋方向へ作用する。","sourceTitle":"Scapular biomechanics review","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3811730/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK537148/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"69","rightsBasis":"肩甲帯運動学を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-070","subject":"運動学","topic":"膝関節の運動学","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"開放運動連鎖で膝を屈曲位から完全伸展へ近づけるときに生じるscrew-home mechanismとして代表的なのはどれか。","choices":["脛骨の外旋","脛骨の内旋","脛骨の後方並進だけ","膝蓋骨の外旋だけ","大腿骨頭の内旋"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"open chain終末伸展＝脛骨外旋。屈曲開始時はpopliteusがunlockして内旋。","explanation":"開放運動連鎖では膝終末伸展で脛骨が大腿骨に対して外旋するscrew-home movementが生じ、関節安定性を高める。屈曲開始時にはこのロックを解除する方向へ回旋する。","sourceTitle":"Screw-home mechanism of the knee","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33554884/","https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15797589/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"70","rightsBasis":"膝運動学の一般原則を独自作問。動画・図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-071","subject":"運動学","topic":"体幹伸展を制動する靱帯","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"脊柱の過度な伸展を主に制限する靱帯はどれか。","choices":["前縦靱帯","後縦靱帯","棘上靱帯","棘間靱帯","黄色靱帯"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"前縦靱帯＝伸展制限。後縦・棘上・棘間・黄色靱帯＝主に屈曲側で緊張。","explanation":"前縦靱帯は椎体前面を縦走し、脊柱伸展時に緊張して過伸展を制限する。後縦靱帯や棘上・棘間靱帯などは主に屈曲時に緊張する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Spine Ligament Anatomy","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK459248/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"71","rightsBasis":"公式図版は第三者権利未解決のため不使用。靱帯機能を文章問題へ独自置換。","originType":"originalized_without_official_media","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-072","subject":"運動学","topic":"努力性呼気筋","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"努力性呼気で胸腔内圧を高め、呼気を助ける筋はどれか。","choices":["腹直筋","横隔膜だけ","外肋間筋だけ","胸鎖乳突筋だけ","斜角筋だけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"努力性呼気＝腹筋群＋内肋間筋。安静呼気は主に受動的。","explanation":"安静呼気は肺・胸郭の弾性収縮による受動過程が中心だが、努力性呼気では腹直筋、腹斜筋、腹横筋などが腹圧を高め、横隔膜を押し上げて呼気を助ける。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Respiratory Muscles","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK482501/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"72","rightsBasis":"呼吸運動学の一般事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-073","subject":"運動学","topic":"上肢筋の作用","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"上腕筋の主な作用はどれか。","choices":["肘関節屈曲","肘関節伸展","肩関節外転","前腕回内だけ","手関節背屈"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"上腕筋＝前腕回内外位に左右されにくい強力な肘屈筋。","explanation":"上腕筋は上腕骨前面から尺骨へ停止し、肘関節屈曲の主働筋として働く。尺骨へ停止するため前腕の回内・回外位による作用変化が比較的小さい。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Brachialis Anatomy","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK545228/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"73","rightsBasis":"上肢筋の基本運動学を独自作問。解剖図は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-074","subject":"運動学","topic":"運動学習","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"運動課題の練習で『目標まで何秒だったか』のように、課題結果そのものを学習者へ知らせるフィードバックはどれか。","choices":["Knowledge of Results（KR）","Knowledge of Performance（KP）","内在的フィードバックだけ","罰刺激だけ","プラセボ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"KR＝結果、KP＝動作の質・やり方。","explanation":"Knowledge of Resultsは目標達成度、時間、距離、得点など運動結果についての外在的フィードバックである。Knowledge of Performanceは動作パターンやフォームなど遂行過程について知らせる。","sourceTitle":"Motor learning feedback review","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4582419/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"74","rightsBasis":"運動学習の概念を独自例で作問。既存教材の例文は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-075","subject":"生理学","topic":"一次免疫応答と免疫グロブリン","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"初めて遭遇した抗原に対する一次免疫応答で、比較的早期に産生される免疫グロブリンはどれか。","choices":["IgM","IgAのみ","IgEのみ","IgDのみ","IgG4のみ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"一次応答＝まずIgM、その後class switchingでIgGなど。二次応答は記憶B細胞により速い。","explanation":"ナイーブB細胞が初めて抗原刺激を受ける一次免疫応答では、まずIgMが産生され、その後クラススイッチによりIgGなど他クラスの抗体が増える。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Humoral Immune Response","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK27140/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"75","rightsBasis":"免疫学の一般原則を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-076","subject":"病理学概論","topic":"過形成","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"過形成（hyperplasia）の定義として最も適切なのはどれか。","choices":["組織を構成する細胞数が増加する","個々の細胞の大きさだけが増加する","細胞数が減少する","正常細胞が必ず悪性化する","壊死細胞だけが増える"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"hyperplasia＝細胞数↑、hypertrophy＝細胞サイズ↑。","explanation":"過形成は増殖可能な細胞の数が増えることで組織・臓器が大きくなる適応である。肥大は個々の細胞サイズが増大する現象であり、両者は併存することもある。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Cellular Adaptation","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK541027/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"76","rightsBasis":"病理学の定義を独自作問。組織画像は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-077","subject":"理学療法","topic":"リンパ浮腫への対応","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"末梢リンパ浮腫の保存的管理として一般に用いられる要素はどれか。","choices":["圧迫療法・運動・スキンケアなどを組み合わせる","患肢運動をすべて禁止する","皮膚感染リスクを無視する","浮腫が強いほど一律に高負荷運動のみ行う","圧迫下でも皮膚状態を確認しない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"リンパ浮腫保存療法＝compression＋exercise＋skin careを軸に個別化。","explanation":"International Society of Lymphologyの2023年コンセンサスでは、末梢リンパ浮腫の保存的管理に圧迫、運動、スキンケア、必要に応じた徒手的手技などを組み合わせる。病期・合併症・患者状況に合わせた個別化が必要である。","sourceTitle":"International Society of Lymphology 2023 Consensus","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39207406/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"77","rightsBasis":"2023 ISLコンセンサスの高位治療原則を独自作問。本文・図表・具体的手技プロトコルは転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-PM-078","subject":"病理学概論","topic":"アポトーシス","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"アポトーシスの特徴として適切なのはどれか。","choices":["調節された細胞死で、細胞内容物の漏出が比較的少ない","必ず広範な炎症を伴う壊死と同義である","細胞膜が早期に破裂して内容物が大量に流出することだけを指す","細胞死を一切伴わない","外傷時にしか起こらない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"apoptosis＝programmed/regulatable cell death、膜保持→断片化→貪食。necrosisと対比。","explanation":